  <h3 id="video-controls-variants">Control Bar Variants</h3>
  <p>
    Without a scrubber, <code>video__timestamp--remaining</code> sizes the
    countdown to its content and <code>video__spacer</code> pushes the buttons
    to the trailing edge. While the media plays,
    <code>video__controls--hidden</code> fades the whole bar out; it returns
    whenever something inside it takes focus.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <div class="video" style="max-width: 640px">
        <video
          poster="https://peach.blender.org/wp-content/uploads/title_anouncement.jpg?x11217"
          aria-label="sample video"
        />
        <div class="video__controls" role="group" aria-label="Video controls">
          <span class="video__timestamp video__timestamp--remaining">
            -0:54
          </span>
          <span class="video__spacer"/>
          <button class="video__control" type="button" aria-label="Play">
            <svg
              class="icon icon--20"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <icon-symbol name="play-20"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
          <button class="video__control" type="button" aria-label="Fullscreen">
            <svg
              class="icon icon--16"
              width="16"
              height="16"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <icon-symbol name="expand-16"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <highlight-code type="html">
    <div class="video">
      <video src="..." preload="metadata" aria-label="Sample video"/>
      <div
        class="video__controls video__controls--hidden"
        role="group"
        aria-label="Video controls"
      >
        <span class="video__timestamp video__timestamp--remaining">-0:54</span>
        <span class="video__spacer"/>
        <button class="video__control" type="button" aria-label="Play">
          <svg class="icon icon--20" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true">
            <use href="#icon-play-20"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </highlight-code>

  <h3 id="video-overlays">Overlays</h3>
  <p>
    <code>video__overlay</code> centers content over the video for error and
    loading states (add <code>video__overlay--transparent</code> for a spinner
    without a scrim). <code>video__play-overlay</code> is a full-bleed poster
    play button, and <code>video__nav</code> is a full-bleed overlay link
    rendered under the control bar.
  </p>

  <div class="demo">
    <div class="demo__inner">
      <div class="video" style="max-width: 640px">
        <video
          poster="https://peach.blender.org/wp-content/uploads/title_anouncement.jpg?x11217"
          aria-label="sample video"
        />
        <div class="video__overlay">
          <svg class="icon icon--24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true">
            <use href="#icon-attention-24"/>
          </svg>
          <div class="video__overlay-text">An error has occurred</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="video" style="max-width: 640px">
        <video
          poster="https://peach.blender.org/wp-content/uploads/title_anouncement.jpg?x11217"
          aria-label="sample video"
        />
        <div class="video__overlay video__overlay--transparent">
          <span
            class="progress-spinner progress-spinner--large"
            role="img"
            aria-label="Video loading"
          >
            <svg class="icon icon--30" aria-hidden="true">
              <use href="#icon-spinner-30"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="video" style="max-width: 640px">
        <video
          poster="https://peach.blender.org/wp-content/uploads/title_anouncement.jpg?x11217"
          aria-label="sample video"
        />
        <button class="video__play-overlay" type="button" aria-label="Play">
          <svg class="icon icon--64" width="64" height="64" aria-hidden="true">
            <use href="#icon-play-filled-64-colored"/>
          </svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="video" style="max-width: 640px">
        <video
          poster="https://peach.blender.org/wp-content/uploads/title_anouncement.jpg?x11217"
          aria-label="sample video"
        />
        <a
          class="video__nav"
          href="https://www.ebay.com"
          aria-label="Watch on eBay"
        />
        <div class="video__controls" role="group" aria-label="Video controls">
          <button class="video__control" type="button" aria-label="Play">
            <svg
              class="icon icon--20"
              width="20"
              height="20"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <icon-symbol name="play-20"/>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <highlight-code type="html">
    <div class="video">
      <video src="..." preload="metadata" aria-label="Sample video"/>
      <a
        class="video__nav"
